{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":true,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"Query records"},"description":"Query a policy-approved ServiceNow table. Returns records with pagination metadata (record_count, has_more, next_offset; no table total, which would cost a COUNT query: page with next_offset until has_more is false). Field verbosity: an explicit fields list always wins; otherwise response_format=\"concise\" (default) uses the table's safe default field set and response_format=\"detailed\" returns all policy-approved readable fields (same as fields=\"all\"). Responses larger than max_response_bytes are truncated by dropping whole records from the tail, with a hint for fetching the rest. Filter example (a list means AND): structured_query={filter:[{type:\"equality\",field:\"active\",operator:\"eq\",value:true},{type:\"text\",field:\"name\",operator:\"contains\",value:\"fleet\"}]}. OR: {type:\"group\",operator:\"or\",conditions:[...]}.","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"definitions":{"StructuredQueryCondition":{"anyOf":[{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"field":{"pattern":"^[a-z][a-z0-9_]{0,79}$","type":"string"},"operator":{"enum":["eq","neq"],"type":"string"},"type":{"const":"equality","type":"string"},"value":{"anyOf":[{"maxLength":512,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},{"type":"number"},{"type":"boolean"}]}},"required":["type","field","operator","value"],"type":"object"},{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"field":{"pattern":"^[a-z][a-z0-9_]{0,79}$","type":"string"},"operator":{"enum":["in","not_in"],"type":"string"},"type":{"const":"set","type":"string"},"values":{"items":{"anyOf":[{"maxLength":512,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},{"type":"number"},{"type":"boolean"}]},"maxItems":20,"minItems":1,"type":"array"}},"required":["type","field","operator","values"],"type":"object"},{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"field":{"pattern":"^[a-z][a-z0-9_]{0,79}$"